Answer: The suggestion is presented to the user for review and acceptance

38. What happens when GitHub Copilot generates more than one code completion suggestion?
Answer: It enables developers to review each suggestion by selecting the left or right arrows.

39. What is the purpose of reviewing and correcting the output generated by GitHub Copilot Chat?
Answer: To ensure the accuracy and completeness of the generated explanations and documentation.

